# Quick Reference

## Local Development

```bash
docker compose up -d postgres   # start DB
make migrate-up                 # apply migrations
cd backend && go run ./cmd/api  # API on :8080
cd frontend && npm install && npm run dev  # UI on :5173
```

## Make Targets

| Command | Purpose |
|---------|---------|
| `make test` | Backend + frontend unit tests |
| `make migrate-up` | Apply all SQL migrations |
| `make migrate-down` | Revert all migrations |
| `make migrate-up-docker` | Migrations via Docker exec |

## Environment Variables

| Variable | Used by |
|----------|---------|
| `DATABASE_URL` | Backend Postgres connection |
| `AUTH_JWT_SECRET` | JWT signing |
| `AUTH_ACCESS_TOKEN_TTL` | Access token lifetime |
| `AUTH_REFRESH_TOKEN_TTL` | Refresh token lifetime |
| `HTTP_PORT` | API listen port |
| `APP_ENV` | Runtime environment |
| `VITE_API_BASE_URL` | Frontend API base URL |

## Key API Routes

```text
POST /api/v1/auth/register|login|refresh
GET  /api/v1/me
POST /api/v1/gyms
GET  /api/v1/gyms/:gymId/members
POST /api/v1/wods          (requires auth + X-Gym-ID)
GET  /api/v1/wods/:id
PUT  /api/v1/wods/:id      (owner only)
```

## Important Paths

| Path | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `backend/cmd/api/main.go` | Composition root |
| `backend/internal/delivery/http/router.go` | Route + middleware wiring |
| `backend/internal/delivery/http/wod_handler.go` | HTTP error mapping |
| `frontend/src/shared/api/httpClient.ts` | Fetch client + auth headers |
| `frontend/src/features/wod/model/wodSchemas.ts` | Form ↔ API payload mapping |
| `docs/EXTENDING_WOD_TYPES.md` | Guide for new workout types |
